:: Deadwood Street Detective Widgets [widget]

<<widget 'deadwood-grant-introduction'>>
  <<if _nam is 'Grant'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        The detective's dark jacket has a pale crease where the sleeves have been rolled back. A badge hangs beside a battered notebook. Black hair is brushed off the forehead, and hazel eyes pause on your face before moving to your hands. "Grant. What have you brought me?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        警探的深色外套袖口留着反复卷起的浅痕，警徽旁放着一本磨旧的记事簿。黑发梳离额头，榛色的眼睛在你的脸上停了停，又看向你的双手。“格兰特。你带来了什么？”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'Grantrelationshiptext'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('StreetLife').bounties.trust gte 60>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='green'>takes your reports seriously</span>, while still checking the details.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class='green'>认真对待你提交的线索</span>，仍会逐项核实细节。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif maplebirch.get('StreetLife').bounties.trust gte 20>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='teal'>recognises your ability</span> to follow a lead through town.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <span class='teal'>认可你在镇上追查线索的本事</span>。
    <</language>>
  <<elseif $StreetLife.bounties.cooperating>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <span class='blue'>expects an accurate account</span> of your work.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        等着你<span class='blue'>如实说明差事的经过</span>。
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        waits to hear why you have come to the station.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        等着你说明来警局的缘由。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget 'deadwood-street-detective-link'>>
  <<deadwood-street-story-entry 'police'>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('StreetLife').bounties.available>>
    <<if (C.npc.Grant.init is 0 or C.npc.Grant.state is 'active') and maplebirch.npc.Schedule.get('Grant').location is 'police_station'>>
      <<icon 'street/detective-notebook.png'>><<lanLink `C.npc.Grant.init === 1 ? ['Speak with Detective Grant (0:01)', '与格兰特警探交谈 (0:01)'] : ['Approach the detective by the noticeboard (0:01)', '走近告示板旁的警探 (0:01)']` 'Deadwood Street Detective'>><<endevent>><<pass 1>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
    <!-- 接案与领款由柜台重验日间营业，夜班仍接收已合作人员带回的目标。 -->
    <<if $StreetLife.bounties.cooperating or $StreetLife.bounties.active>>
      <<icon 'investigate.png'>><<lanLink ['Visit the bounty desk (0:01)', '前往悬赏柜台 (0:01)'] 'Deadwood Street Bounties'>><<endevent>><<pass 1>><</lanLink>><br>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</widget>>

<!-- 闲聊只提供情境与规则，信任由核验后的案件结果改变，不能靠重复点击刷取。 -->
<<widget 'deadwood-street-detective-response'>>
  <<switch _args[0]>>
    <<case 'work'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Grant turns a photograph towards you. "First, make sure you've found the right person. A coat and a bad haircut aren't enough." A finger rests on the description below it. "If they'll come quietly, let them. If you can't bring them in safely, bring me the lead. I pay for the job on the notice, after we've checked it."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          格兰特把一张照片转向你。“先认准人。一件外套，再加个难看的发型，可不够。”手指停在下方的特征说明上。“愿意老实跟你回来，就让人好好走。带不回来，就把线索交给我。告示上写了什么，核实以后就按什么付钱。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'limits'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "You're helping with a case. You aren't being given a badge." Grant taps the notebook shut. "You don't get to search every house, wave a weapon at a stranger, or invent a charge because someone annoyed you. If you bring trouble back here, I'll have to write that down too."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “是请你帮忙查案，不是发给你一枚警徽。”格兰特合上记事簿。“不是看哪扇门都能搜，看谁不顺眼都能亮家伙，再编条罪名。你把麻烦带回来，我也得照样记下来。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'town'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          A raised voice carries through the frosted glass. Grant waits for it to fade before answering. "People here know each other. Sometimes that helps. Sometimes a name on a form means the form sits at the bottom of the pile." The notebook opens again. "Give me something I can check. Not a story about who owes whom a favour."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          磨砂玻璃后传来一阵拔高的说话声。格兰特等声音低下去，才答话。“这里的人彼此都认识。有时候方便办事，有时候表上一个名字，就能让那张表永远压在最底下。”记事簿重新翻开。“给我些能查证的东西。谁欠谁人情那一套，就省了吧。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'contacts'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          "Landry makes introductions. I follow where the money goes. Sooner or later that puts us on opposite sides of a table." Grant draws a line across the page. "I need what you actually saw. Don't warn a target off and then call it bad luck. And don't expect a name on one of my files to make your own file disappear."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          “兰德里牵线，我顺着钱查下去。早晚会坐到同一张桌子的两边。”格兰特在纸上划下一道线。“我需要你说清楚亲眼看到了什么。别先给目标通风报信，再说是运气不好。也别指望帮我填上一份档案，就能让你自己的那份消失。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<case 'wealth'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You say you have other ways to earn money. Grant studies you for a moment. "Then you can afford to leave a bad lead alone. Someone desperate for the reward might see the face they want to see." The photograph slides back across the desk. "Same checks. Same payment. I'm not bidding against your other business."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你表示，自己还有别的赚钱路子。格兰特打量你片刻。“那你就更能放过一条不可靠的线索。急着拿赏钱的人，有时会把谁都看成想找的那张脸。”照片被推回桌面。“一样核验，一样付钱。我可不打算跟你的其他生意竞价。”
      <</language>><br><br>
  <</switch>>
<</widget>>

:: Deadwood Street Detective
<<set $location to 'police_station'>><<set $outside to 0>><<effects>>
<<set _detectiveWork to maplebirch.get('StreetLife').bounties>>
<<if !_detectiveWork.available or (C.npc.Grant.init isnot 0 and C.npc.Grant.state isnot 'active') or maplebirch.npc.Schedule.get('Grant').location isnot 'police_station'>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The desk beside the noticeboard is empty. A member of staff points you back towards reception.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      告示板旁的办公桌前没人。路过的职员指了指前台，让你先回那边等。
  <</language>><br><br>
<<else>>
  <<npc 'Grant'>><<person1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Grant works at a small desk beside the noticeboard. The kettle clicks off behind a stack of folders. From here, the lobby is visible through a strip of glass in the door; people at reception have to raise their voices to be heard.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      格兰特在告示板旁的一张小桌前办公。一摞文件夹后，水壶咔嗒一声断了电。门上那条玻璃能看见大厅，前台的人说话时，总得把嗓门抬高些。
  <</language>><br><br>
  <<if _detectiveWork.wanted>>
    <<if $StreetLife.bounties.active>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Grant places your assignment beside another file. "Anything you've brought back gets recorded at the counter. This one doesn't go away because of that." A finger rests on the second file. "No new work or reward until you've dealt with your own record. Reception can tell you the rest."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          格兰特把你的委托放在另一份档案旁。“带回了什么，到柜台照样登记。但这份不会因此消失。”手指按在第二份档案上。“先处理你自己的记录，再谈新差事和赏金。剩下的去前台问。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <<else>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Grant leaves the folder closed. "Before we talk about someone else's file, there's yours. Speak to reception." The detective glances towards the front desk. "An offer to help doesn't settle what's already recorded."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          格兰特没翻开文件夹。“谈别人的档案之前，先说说你自己的。去前台吧。”警探向柜台那边看了一眼。“来帮忙，并不能把已经记下的事情一笔勾销。”
      <</language>><br><br>
    <</if>>
  <<elseif $StreetLife.bounties.active>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "How far did you get?" Grant pulls the current file out of the pile. "Tell me where you saw them. If you've brought someone back, we check the identity before anything else."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “查到哪一步了？”格兰特从那摞文件里抽出当前的档案。“说说你在哪里见到了人。如果带了人回来，先核对身份。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif !$StreetLife.bounties.cooperating and ($StreetLife.bounties.completed gt 0 or $StreetLife.bounties.leads gt 0 or $StreetLife.bounties.last)>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Grant leaves the assignment forms in their tray. "You said you were finished with this work. Changed your mind, or is there something else?" The detective turns the notebook towards a clean page.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        格兰特没有拿取托盘里的委托表。“你说过不接这些差事了。改主意了，还是另有事要谈？”警探把记事簿翻到空白的一页。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif $StreetLife.bounties.last and $StreetLife.bounties.last.outcome isnot 'paid'>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<switch $StreetLife.bounties.last.outcome>>
          <<case 'lead'>>
            "Your report checked out." Grant closes the file. "We'll take it from there. I'd rather have a useful lead than someone dragged in just to collect the full reward."
          <<case 'released'>>
            "The person you let go is still wanted." Grant keeps a finger on the notice. "If there's something wrong with the case, bring me the details. Letting them walk doesn't settle it."
          <<case 'interrupted'>>
            Grant finds the entry for your unfinished assignment. "Start with where you had to stop. I need to know what still needs checking before anyone goes back out."
          <<case 'abandoned'>>
            "I've put that file back with the others." Grant sets the notebook beside it. "Tell me what you managed to find. Someone else may be able to pick up where you left off."
        <</switch>>
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<switch $StreetLife.bounties.last.outcome>>
          <<case 'lead'>>
            “你报来的消息，核实过了。”格兰特合上档案。“后面交给我们。能带回有用的线索，总比为了领全额赏金，硬拖个人回来强。”
          <<case 'released'>>
            “你放走的那个人，还在通缉。”格兰特的手指按在告示上。“觉得案子有问题，就拿具体的事来说。把人放了，事情可没完。”
          <<case 'interrupted'>>
            格兰特找到那份没办完的委托记录。“先说说，你在哪里停下的。再派人出去之前，我得知道还有哪些事没查清。”
          <<case 'abandoned'>>
            “档案已经放回去了。”格兰特把记事簿搁在旁边。“说说你查到了什么。换个人去，也许能接着查下去。”
        <</switch>>
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif $StreetLife.bounties.completed gt 0>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        Grant recognises you before you reach the desk, moving a mug off the nearest chair. <<if _detectiveWork.trust gte 60>>"You know what to check by now. Have a look, and tell me what you think."<<elseif _detectiveWork.trust gte 20>>"There are a few files I can let you follow further now."<<else>>"Another job, or something about the last one?"<</if>> A fresh sheet is pulled towards the edge of the desk.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你还没走到桌前，格兰特就认出了你，把最近那张椅子上的杯子挪开。<<if _detectiveWork.trust gte 60>>“该查些什么，你已经熟了。先看看，再说说你的想法。”<<elseif _detectiveWork.trust gte 20>>“有几份档案，现在可以让你往下查了。”<<else>>“接新差事，还是有上次的事要说？”<</if>>一张新的表格被抽到桌沿。
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif $StreetLife.bounties.cooperating>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Have a look at what's open." Grant gestures towards the notices. "Take one you can follow through. If you change your mind, tell me before someone else goes looking."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “看看还有什么没办完。”格兰特朝告示板示意。“挑一件你能追到底的。要是改主意了，先告诉我，别等别人也开始到处找人。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<elseif maplebirch.get('StreetLife').reputation gte 50>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "I've heard your name around." Grant sets a pencil across an open file. "You seem to get things from one end of town to the other. Can you follow a lead as carefully?"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “听过你的名字。”格兰特把铅笔横放在打开的档案上。“看起来，你挺会把东西从镇子这头送到那头。追查线索，也能这么仔细吗？”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "If you're looking for work, there are notices." Grant lays a blank form between you. "I'll explain what each one asks for. You can decide whether it's worth your time."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        “找活干的话，这里有告示。”格兰特把一张空白表格放到你面前。“每份要做什么，我可以讲清楚。值不值得花你的时间，由你自己决定。”
    <</language>><br><br>
  <</if>>

  <div id='deadwood-detective-response'></div>
  <<deadwood-street-bailey-police-link>>
  <<deadwood-street-heist-grant>>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask what the work involves', '询问差事要做些什么']>>
    <<replace '#deadwood-detective-response'>><<deadwood-street-detective-response 'work'>><</replace>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask what you are allowed to do', '询问自己能做些什么']>>
    <<replace '#deadwood-detective-response'>><<deadwood-street-detective-response 'limits'>><</replace>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask about policing the town', '谈谈镇上的警务']>>
    <<replace '#deadwood-detective-response'>><<deadwood-street-detective-response 'town'>><</replace>>
  <</lanLink>><br>
  <<if maplebirch.get('StreetLife').reputation gte 20>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Ask whether your contacts matter', '问街头关系是否影响合作']>>
      <<replace '#deadwood-detective-response'>><<deadwood-street-detective-response 'contacts'>><</replace>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('Finance')?.netDeposit gte 10000000>>
    <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Say you have other ways to earn money', '说自己有别的赚钱门路']>>
      <<replace '#deadwood-detective-response'>><<deadwood-street-detective-response 'wealth'>><</replace>>
    <</lanLink>><br>
  <</if>><br>

  <<if !_detectiveWork.wanted>>
    <<if !$StreetLife.bounties.cooperating>>
      <<socialiseicon 'ask'>><<lanLink ['Agree to help with enquiries (0:10)', '同意协助查案 (0:10)'] 'Deadwood Street Detective'>>
        <<if _detectiveWork.act('cooperate')>><<pass 10>><</if>>
      <</lanLink>><br>
    <<else>>
      <<icon 'street/case-board.png'>><<lanLink ['Look over the open cases (0:01)', '查看待办案件 (0:01)'] 'Deadwood Street Bounties'>><<pass 1>><</lanLink>><br>
      <<if !$StreetLife.bounties.active>>
        <<refuseicon>><<lanLink ['Stop taking police work', '停止接取警方差事'] 'Deadwood Street Detective'>><<run _detectiveWork.act('quit')>><</lanLink>><br>
      <</if>>
    <</if>>
  <</if>>
<</if>><br>

<!-- 先结束警探对话并清空遭遇槽，原版大厅自行生成前台警员，避免触发 checkEventNPC 替换命名 NPC。 -->
<<getouticon>><<lanLink ['Return to reception', '返回前台'] 'Police Station'>><<endevent>><</lanLink>><br>
